  "description": "Add a fresh and versatile touch to your creative projects with this green diagonal stripes seamless pattern. Featuring clean, repeating angled lines, this classic design is ideal for digital scrapbooking, stationery, invitations, packaging, fabric projects, planners, backgrounds, wallpapers, and DIY crafts. The seamless format makes it easy to create continuous repeating designs for both personal and commercial creative projects.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• JPEG format\n• 3600 x 3600 pixels\n• Seamless, repeatable designs\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and digital paper\n• Fabric and textile projects\n• Planner and stationery designs\n• Invitations and greeting cards\n• Packaging and branding\n• Sublimation and print projects\n• Digital backgrounds\n• Web and social media graphics\n• Crafting and DIY projects\n• Printable designs",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a fresh and versatile touch to your creative projects with this green diagonal stripes seamless pattern. Featuring clean, repeating angled lines, this classic design is ideal for digital scrapbooking, stationery, invitations, packaging, fabric projects, planners, backgrounds, wallpapers, and DIY crafts. The seamless format makes it easy to create continuous repeating designs for both personal and commercial creative projects.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n• 15 seamless patterns<br>\n• JPEG format<br>\n• 3600 x 3600 pixels<br>\n• Seamless, repeatable designs<br>\n• High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n• Scrapbooking and digital paper<br>\n• Fabric and textile projects<br>\n• Planner and stationery designs<br>\n• Invitations and greeting cards<br>\n• Packaging and branding<br>\n• Sublimation and print projects<br>\n• Digital backgrounds<br>\n• Web and social media graphics<br>\n• Crafting and DIY projects<br>\n• Printable designs</p>",
